exports[`screens > welcome and help 1`] = `
"$ agentcurfew 
[exit 0]
agentcurfew 0.0.0: inventory, lock and check what steers your AI coding agents.

Common commands:
  agentcurfew scan    Check what steers agents in a project against the rules
  agentcurfew lock    Write agentcurfew.lock with a checksum of every component
  agentcurfew verify  Exit with 1 when a component changed since agentcurfew.lock
  agentcurfew doctor  Find configuration that agents ignore or that does not work

Run agentcurfew help to see every command, or agentcurfew help <command> for one.
"
`;

exports[`screens > welcome and help 2`] = `
"$ agentcurfew help
[exit 0]
agentcurfew: inventory, lock and check what steers your AI coding agents.

Usage: agentcurfew <command> [options]

Commands:
  scan     Check what steers agents in a project against the rules
  lock     Write agentcurfew.lock with a checksum of every component
  verify   Exit with 1 when a component changed since agentcurfew.lock
  init     Write agentcurfew.policy.json from what the project has now
  doctor   Find configuration that agents ignore or that does not work
  mcp      Serve read-only checks to an agent over MCP (stdio)
  hook     Check a tool call of Claude Code before it runs (used as a hook)
  explain  Say what a rule finds, why it matters and how to fix it
  help     Show every command, or the help of one

Options:
  -h, --help     Show help; agentcurfew <command> --help shows the help of a command
  -v, --version  Show the version

Run agentcurfew help <command> for the options and examples of a command.
"
`;
